            "column_gap": 50,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "heading": "What this means when you are shopping",
            "heading_font": "serif",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "mobile_heading_size": 28,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_indent": 0,
            "mobile_heading_indent": 0,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/One_thing_worth_knowing_1.png",
            "image_max_width": 500,
            "heading_image_gap": 16,
            "mobile_heading_image_gap": 20,
            "body_text": "<p>Always check the concentration label before purchasing. If longevity is your primary concern, avoid Eau de Toilette (5-15% oil) and look strictly for Eau de Parfum (15-20%) or Extrait de Parfum (20-30%).</p><p>At Scentspired, our formulations feature high oil percentages designed to cling to moisturized skin throughout an entire workday, giving you confidence that your scent will still be turning heads by 7 PM.</p>",
